{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54515","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商音姓，军阵见[云从]（从营）（从辛本、京本改。\n）白与黑时（京本作「兮」）吾大吉，青云亦（京本作「主」）胜赤云凶，黄者两平踪。\n（辛本注：「主取天子姓，不主出帅姓。\n」京本注：「天子出，取天子姓，不出则以主将。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}